  popupId: level05_intro
  pages:
  - title: Level 5 - Leaking pipes
    body: Old water pipes run under this house. Every now and then one bursts and
      floods the floor around it.
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Wet floors
    body: 'Puddles on the floor are slippery - you can slip and drop what you''re
      carrying.


      Wait for the water to dry or walk around it.'
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Water + electricity
    body: Keep water and sockets apart! A spark that reaches a puddle electrifies
      it and shocks anyone standing in it.
    image: {fileID: 0}
